OL,3,AUK economy sees surprise growth in
OL,4,AAugust ahead of Healey's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK's economy recorded surprise
OL,7,Fgrowth in August despite the impact of
OL,8,Frising energy prices and borrowing
OL,9,Fcosts.
OL,11,FOfficial figures showed the economy
OL,12,Fexpanded by 0.1% in the month, defying
OL,13,Fanalysts' expectations of a slight
OL,14,Fcontraction.
OL,16,FIt means the economy grew by 0.7% in
OL,17,Fthe three months to August, and follows
OL,18,Fan upgrade to this year's forecast for
OL,19,Fthe UK economy from global watchdog the
OL,20,FInternational Monetary Fund (IMF).
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
