OL,3,AUK economy sees surprise growth in
OL,4,AAugust ahead of Healey's first Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FChancellor John Healey, who will
OL,7,Fdeliver his first Budget in two weeks,
OL,8,Fsaid the UK has shown resilience in the
OL,9,Fface of conflicts in Europe and the
OL,10,FMiddle East.
